  "_comment": [
    "Golden set for the Class 6 Science library (Maharashtra State Bureau).",
    "Each answerable question names the chapter heading its answer sits under;",
    "matching is by heading rather than chunk id, because chunk ids do not",
    "survive a re-ingest and a golden set that has to be rebuilt every time the",
    "chunker changes is one nobody maintains.",
    "",
    "Four slices. The English and Devanagari ones measure ranking. The romanized",
    "one is the input the ceilings are most likely to mishandle -- read as",
    "English it takes the strictest ceiling and loses a correct hit at 0.51. The",
    "out-of-syllabus one is the only test that can tell a working gate from one",
    "that has been tuned into permissiveness.",
    "",
    "language is the SESSION language, as the ASR selection or UI toggle would",
    "set it -- not a guess from the text."
